[00:21.78]We live in a world that is wayward and lost;
[00:25.82]The way of our God is not known.
[00:29.87]We need sure direction to safeguard our steps;
[00:34.68]We cannot succeed on our own.
[00:39.12]Our meetings refresh us and brighten our hope;
[00:43.40]They help us build faith in our God.
[00:47.88]They move us with words that incite to fine deeds,
[00:52.02]They give us the strength to go on.
[00:56.24]We’ll never forsake what Jehovah commands;
[01:00.80]His will is what we want to do.
[01:05.32]Our meetings instruct us in ways that are right;
[01:09.64]Our love for the truth they renew.
[01:23.10]Jehovah is keenly aware of our needs;
[01:27.04]His counsel by us should be heard.
[01:31.24]To buy out the time for occasions to meet
[01:35.84]Shows wisdom and trust in his Word.
[01:40.28]By wholesome instruction from God-fearing men,
[01:44.56]We learn how our faith can be shown.
[01:49.00]With loving support from our fam’ly of faith,
[01:53.24]We know that we’re never alone.
[01:57.40]So as we look forward to much better times,
[02:01.86]We’ll meet with the ones whom we love.
[02:06.40]And here at these meetings we’ll learn how to live
[02:10.48]With wisdom that comes from above.
